            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "figure_title",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">• Tahoe-100M (Zhang et al., 2025): a single-cell perturbation atlas profiling 50 cancer cell lines under ~1,200 drug perturbations, released by Tahoe Therapeutics (formerly Vevo Therapeutics) in February 2025. Both post-cutoff and structurally excluded from Genecorpus-30M, which explicitly removed immortalized lines. n = 50,000 subsampled.</div>\n",
